# Product / Design

When changing UX/UI:
- Read `docs/00_PROJECT_BRIEF.md`, `docs/01_PRODUCT_POLICY.md`, and `docs/09_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` as needed.
- Define the user goal before proposing UI.
- Consider Default / Loading / Empty / Error / Disabled / Success states.
- Check long text, narrow viewport, keyboard/focus, and recovery paths.
- Reuse existing tokens/components before creating new variants.
- Do not change pricing, account, privacy, or product policy through UI implementation.
